From b1147a0c17f5c50785cf7ed16622b4ece56c258d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: terminills <tdeters@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 26 Jul 2026 04:22:42 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 31/43] AROS: avoid cleared RenderThread during extension
 teardown

AI_PHASE: cef-osr-browser

AI_STATUS: archive-clean-runtime-pending

ROOT_CAUSE: WillDestroyCurrentMessageLoop runs after the RenderThread global has been cleared, so Shutdown dereferenced a null RenderThread while trying to remove an observer whose owner list was already destroyed.

FIX_REASON: Release the extension dispatcher and request policy on their renderer sequence without consulting the cleared RenderThread singleton.

VALIDATION: hosted replay painted and closed, removed the prior Mojo wrong-sequence fatal, and isolated the new null dereference at CefExtensionsRendererClient::Shutdown+0x23; corrected obj/cef/libcef.a rebuild passed.

AI_LIMITATIONS: corrected native cef.library relink and hosted shutdown replay remain pending.

AI_DECISION_CHAIN:; aa68073e renderer-sequence teardown; 07-runtime null RenderThread failure

Evidence:-cef-final-runtime-20260726/extension-renderer-teardown-pass/07-runtime.log

Job:
---
 libcef/renderer/extensions/extensions_renderer_client.cc | 5 ++---
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/libcef/renderer/extensions/extensions_renderer_client.cc b/libcef/renderer/extensions/extensions_renderer_client.cc
index e6afe4bd..38062f29 100644
--- a/libcef/renderer/extensions/extensions_renderer_client.cc
+++ b/libcef/renderer/extensions/extensions_renderer_client.cc
@@ -52,9 +52,8 @@ CefExtensionsRendererClient::CefExtensionsRendererClient(
 CefExtensionsRendererClient::~CefExtensionsRendererClient() = default;
 
 void CefExtensionsRendererClient::Shutdown() {
-  if (extension_dispatcher_) {
-    content::RenderThread::Get()->RemoveObserver(extension_dispatcher_.get());
-  }
+  // RenderThread::Get() is already cleared when this message-loop teardown
+  // callback runs. Its observer list has therefore also been destroyed.
   resource_request_policy_.reset();
   extension_dispatcher_.reset();
 }
